  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The angle made by the vector on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>axis</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Let the vector be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>.</p><p>It is given that</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;component is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
